<h2 id="day-0-521">Day 0 5.21</h2>
<p>对了jb的AJZ答案，发现自己二试<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T4&gt;T3&gt;T1&gt;T2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.72243em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">4</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.72243em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.72243em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>？平面几何直接爬，<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span>真的水结果还是搞烂了，<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span>什么牛马组合还考了<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Lucas</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault">L</span><span class="mord mathdefault">u</span><span class="mord mathdefault">c</span><span class="mord mathdefault">a</span><span class="mord mathdefault">s</span></span></span></span>和<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Kummer</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.07153em;">K</span><span class="mord mathdefault">u</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">e</span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span></span></span></span>定理...搞了一晚上电脑，明天直接摆烂了🤣</p>
<h2 id="day-1-522">Day 1 5.22</h2>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">7:00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">7</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>准时起床，颓了1个多小时B站和sgs，反正是预赛也懒得复习了（（😅</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8:30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">8</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>到校，和同样不认路的wsq找了十分钟的考场</p>
<p>入场后和久别重逢的物竞同学闲聊一会、、</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9:00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">9</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>准时开考，拿到卷子一眼先看到<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>牛马映射题，，要不是之前看过一点线代，估计题也读不懂（</p>
<p>开始后经典从前往后做，前5题中规中矩，先<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">5</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">i</span><span class="mord mathdefault">n</span></span></span></span>切掉<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span>、<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>，第四题的裂项也没耗费多少时间就搞出来了。</p>
<p>一直到搞定前5题用了<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">15min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">5</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">i</span><span class="mord mathdefault">n</span></span></span></span>左右。</p>
<p>结果到第6题被卡了一会儿，一个奇怪的不等式，瞎鸡儿搞出个答案，就很诡异，到了第7题是着实傻了，不过原本考前预想就是看到玄学组合直接跳，耗时还长正确率还不高，结果第8题题也读错，一直做不出，服了。</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9:30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">9</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>做到第8题，前面还跳了两题</p>
<p>不过第9题还好，简单的容斥原理，幸亏是<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>143</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">143</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">4</span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span>不然要算死</p>
<p>第十题也还行，暴力设出来即可</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>00</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10:00</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span>左右连蒙带猜搞定填空题，开始噩梦模式的大题</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span>解析几何一开始没看清条件，发现根本没法算，看到有<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p,k \in \mathbb{Z}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault">p</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.16666666666666666em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">∈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.771331em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbb">Z</span></span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.771331em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mbin mtight">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>很快就搞定了（大约用了<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">15min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">5</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">i</span><span class="mord mathdefault">n</span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>一个玄学映射狗题，前面花了一点时间琢磨，也是很快想出递推的做法，但好像忽略了恒等映射，完蛋（原本自信满满用了<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">i</span><span class="mord mathdefault">n</span></span></span></span>做完，结果，唉）</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span>有点奇怪？我感觉水的过分？真是几步解决，很诡异</p>
<p>不过当时心态贼好，做完<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span>还有<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">30min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">i</span><span class="mord mathdefault">n</span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">4</span></span></span></span>玄学数列题，第一问归纳法很快做完，但第二问没啥头绪，一开始直接伪证，后来发现好像还是伪证了，然后就差不多了</p>
<p><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10:45</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">4</span><span class="mord">5</span></span></span></span>开始整<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">5</span></span></span></span>，发现什么牛马函数方程题（lzl不是说联赛不会考的吗，服了），第一问用个同余很快搞定，第二问直接战术放弃，争取一点暴力分((</p>
<p>最后竟然还多了<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mord mathdefault">m</span><span class="mord mathdefault">i</span><span class="mord mathdefault">n</span></span></span></span>左右，开始乱摆。</p>
<p>总的说来可能还行，毕竟答案还没出不能说得太满，到时候算错光就搞笑了。</p>
<p>毕竟是个预赛，就这样吧。</p>
<h3 id="updated"><strong><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Updated</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.10903em;">U</span><span class="mord mathdefault">p</span><span class="mord mathdefault">d</span><span class="mord mathdefault">a</span><span class="mord mathdefault">t</span><span class="mord mathdefault">e</span><span class="mord mathdefault">d</span></span></span></span></strong>：</h3>
<p>已对完答案，填空题果然就错了<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">7</span></span></span></span>、<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">8</span></span></span></span>。唉大题好像爆裂了，圆锥曲线好像对了，<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span>没考虑恒等映射所以式子推错了/kk,<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathdefault" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span>方法好像伪证了，和答案完全不一样。<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex"